<title>JAPAN: Gantan Beauty -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Gantan Beauty -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.09		vs	    5.38</p>
<p> Operating	   28    million	  vs	  179    million</p>
<p> Current	loss 73    million	  vs	 prft 95 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 89    million	  vs	 prft 17 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 12.32 yen	  vs     prft 2.45 yen</p>
<p> Shares		7 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Gantan Beauty Industry Co Ltd is a manufacturer-marketer of metal roofing materials.</p>
</text>
